capability_routing
  issue 1138
  routing_enabled true
  routing_note "Plan 10 leaf 9 wired the table ahead of the cue-phrase path behind this field, and leaf 11 flipped it on. Setting it to false returns routing to data/seed/agentic-tool-capabilities.lino cue matching, which is how the two are compared without a Rust edit."
  purpose "Capability is a function of the object in the request, the act asked for, and where the effect lands. Verbs select the act; they never select the capability. A triple with no row asks rather than guesses."
  dialogue_utterance_note "A request made only of the surfaces of these roles (and function words) is a dialogue act the engine answers in the reply -- a bare hi is a greeting, not a bare term to search the web for (the opencode greeting leg searched it and read a dictionary page)."
  dialogue_utterance_role social_greeting
  dialogue_utterance_role social_wellbeing
  dialogue_utterance_role social_farewell
  dialogue_utterance_role social_courtesy_response
  dialogue_utterance_role social_test_status
  dialogue_utterance_role social_assistant_name
  dialogue_utterance_role social_identity
  dialogue_utterance_role social_assistant_free_time
